will shatter "},{"t":"old","s":["H2205"],"a":[6]},{"t":" man and "},{"t":"young","s":["H5288"],"a":[7]},{"t":", And with you I will shatter young "},{"t":"man","s":["H0970"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"virgin","s":["H1330"],"a":[11]},{"t":","}]},{"n":23,"text":"And with you I will shatter the shepherd and his flock, And with you I will shatter the farmer and his yoke of oxen, And with you I will shatter governors and officials.","tok":[{"t":"And with you I will shatter the "},{"t":"shepherd","s":["H7462"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and his "},{"t":"flock","s":["H5739"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And with you I will shatter the farmer and his yoke of "},{"t":"oxen","s":["H6776"],"a":[7]},{"t":", And with you I will shatter governors and officials."}]},{"n":24,"text":"And I will repay Babylon And all the inhabitants of Chaldea With all their evil which they have done In Zion before your eyes, declares Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"And I will repay "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[1]},{"t":" And all the "},{"t":"inhabitants","s":["H3427"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Chaldea","s":["H3778"],"a":[4]},{"t":" With all their "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[7]},{"t":" which they have "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[9]},{"t":" In "},{"t":"Zion","s":["H6726"],"a":[10]},{"t":" before your eyes, declares "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":25,"text":"Indeed, I am against you, O mountain of destruction, Declares Jehovah, Which destroys the whole earth; And I will stretch out My hand upon you And roll you down from the rocks And make you a burning mountain.","tok":[{"t":"Indeed, I am against you, O "},{"t":"mountain","s":["H2022"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of destruction, Declares "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":", Which "},{"t":"destroys","s":["H7843"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the whole "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[9]},{"t":"; And I will stretch "},{"t":"out","s":["H5186"],"a":[10]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[12]},{"t":" upon you And roll you "},{"t":"down",