":"; And the nations, only for "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0784"],"a":[19]},{"t":"; and they will have wearied themselves."}]},{"n":59,"text":"The word which Jeremiah the prophet commanded Seraiah the son of Neriah, the son of Mahseiah, when he went with Zedekiah the king of Judah to Babylon in the fourth year of his reign. (Now Seraiah was quartermaster.)","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[0]},{"t":" which "},{"t":"Jeremiah","s":["H3414"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"prophet","s":["H5030"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"commanded","s":["H6680"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Seraiah","s":["H8304"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Neriah","s":["H5374"],"a":[8]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of Mahseiah, when he "},{"t":"went","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"Zedekiah","s":["H6667"],"a":[13]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[15]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[16]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"fourth","s":["H7243"],"a":[18]},{"t":" "},{"t":"year","s":["H8141"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of his "},{"t":"reign","s":["H4427"],"a":[19]},{"t":". (Now "},{"t":"Seraiah","s":["H8304"],"a":[20]},{"t":" was quartermaster.)"}]},{"n":60,"text":"And Jeremiah wrote in a book all the evil that would come on Babylon, even all these words that are written concerning Babylon.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Jeremiah","s":["H3414"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wrote","s":["H3789"],"a":[0]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"a","s":["H0259"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"book","s":["H5612"],"a":[10]},{"t":" all the "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[4]},{"t":" that would "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[6]},{"t":" on "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[8]},{"t":", even all these "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[14]},{"t":" that are "},{"t":"written","s":["H3789"],"a":[16]},{"t":" concerning "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":61,"text":"And Jeremiah said to S